post_install() {
    cat <<'EOF'

==> niri-screensaver installed.

Three things to wire up before it'll trigger:

  1. niri window-rule — append to ~/.config/niri/config.kdl (or include):
       /usr/share/doc/niri-screensaver/niri-window-rule.kdl

  2. Idle integration — pick one:
       * Noctalia plugin (recommended)
           ln -s /usr/share/niri-screensaver/noctalia-plugin \
                 ~/.config/noctalia/plugins/niri-screensaver
         then enable in Noctalia → Settings → Plugins.
       * Inline Noctalia custom-command snippet:
           /usr/share/doc/niri-screensaver/noctalia-customCommand.json

  3. Test it inline (no fullscreen):
       niri-screensaver-ctl test

Optional now-playing overlay needs playerctl; cursor parking needs wlrctl
(both listed as optional deps).

EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
    post_install
}
